# Citation metadata for MESA (https://citation-file-format.github.io/).
# Before the 1.0 release: replace the placeholder author with the real author, and add
# version and date-released. A DOI is added later, once one exists.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MESA in your work, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "MESA: static analysis of microservice architecture"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The MESA authors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ilmeedesilva/MESA"
abstract: >-
  MESA reads the source code and configuration of a microservice system and finds
  architecture problems between services: cyclic dependencies, shared databases,
  hard-coded service addresses, chatty services and god services. It reports each
  finding with its file and line, why it matters and how to fix it, and can check
  pull requests in CI for new problems.
keywords:
  - microservices
  - software architecture
  - static analysis
  - anti-patterns
  - architecture fitness
